<h1>The long way home</h1>
<div class="stamp">October, late</div>
<p>I meant to post a letter and ended up following the towpath as far as the second lock. A grey heron stood in the
shallows for the whole of my stay and did not mind me at all.</p>
<p>The lock keeper told me the bench by the footbridge was built from an old gate. I sat on it for a while. Back to the
<a href="/">latest entries</a>.</p>
